---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="Understand how some Domain Discoverer links to registrars and research tools may earn commissions.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container-pad"><p class="eyebrow">Legal / Transparency</p><h1 class="display">A clear word about <em>external links.</em></h1><p>Why we link to third-party services and what that means for you.</p></div></section>
  <section class="container-pad legal-content"><article class="prose">
    <h2>Some links may be affiliate links</h2><p>If you follow certain links to a domain registrar or research service and make a qualifying purchase, Domain Discoverer may earn a commission. This may help support the site. It does not mean every external link is an affiliate link.</p>
    <h2>Our editorial approach</h2><p>We aim to explain the purpose and limitations of tools, not promise that any provider is suitable for every visitor. We do not charge visitors to read guides or use the on-site domain checker.</p>
    <h2>Before making a purchase</h2><p>Always check current fees, eligibility requirements, privacy settings and renewal prices on the provider's own website. Domain Discoverer does not control those prices or terms.</p>
    <h2>Questions?</h2><p>Reach us via our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
  </article></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.legal-content { padding-top: 4rem; }</style>
